{"path":"results/simple-ideas-10x10-p2-5-len4g3-comp0-7-bounties-from-5-scaling-ladder-20261024/summary.md","title":"Scaling: Hard graph (10 × 10)","html":"<h1>Scaling: Hard graph (10 × 10)</h1>\n<p><strong>Question:</strong> On a hard idea graph, how does what each society achieves grow with its budget (750 to 96000)?</p>\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> At budgets 750–24000: best OSO (α = 0.2, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money and waste. At budget 48000: best OSO (α = 0.8, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money, money to the main level and waste. At budget 96000: best OSO (α = 0.8, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge per unit of money, money to the main level and waste; no clear difference on hardest level and knowledge found (bits). (Compared at each budget; 8 measures, a clear difference is more than 2.7 standard errors.)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Budget 750: hardest level: 4.90 against traditional 0.00, clearly better. targets solved: 0.50 against traditional 0.00, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 1500: hardest level: 6.07 against traditional 0.00, clearly better. targets solved: 1.80 against traditional 0.00, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 3000: hardest level: 7.63 against traditional 0.00, clearly better. targets solved: 3.50 against traditional 0.00, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 6000: hardest level: 8.80 against traditional 1.53, clearly better. targets solved: 5.87 against traditional 0.33, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 12000: hardest level: 9.73 against traditional 6.00, clearly better. targets solved: 9.23 against traditional 3.00, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 24000: hardest level: 10 against traditional 7.40, clearly better. targets solved: 11 against traditional 5.70, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 48000: hardest level: 10 against traditional 9.03, clearly better. targets solved: 12 against traditional 8.73, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 96000: hardest level: 10 against traditional 9.97, no clear difference. targets solved: 12 against traditional 11, clearly better.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"files/results/simple-ideas-10x10-p2-5-len4g3-comp0-7-bounties-from-5-scaling-ladder-20261024/figures/compare.svg\" alt=\"Scaling: Hard graph (10 × 10)\"></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>society</th>\n<th>budget</th>\n<th>frontier</th>\n<th>targets solved</th>\n<th>value gained</th>\n<th>ROI (value per spend)</th>\n<th>knowledge (bits)</th>\n<th>bits per money</th>\n<th>cost</th>\n<th>waste</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>750</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0 ± 0</td>\n<td>0.00 ± 0.00</td>\n<td>40 ± 6</td>\n<td>0.054 ± 0.008</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.22 ± 0.06</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>1500</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0 ± 0</td>\n<td>0.00 ± 0.00</td>\n<td>58 ± 9</td>\n<td>0.039 ± 0.006</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.33 ± 0.07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>3000</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0 ± 0</td>\n<td>0.00 ± 0.00</td>\n<td>85 ± 11</td>\n<td>0.029 ± 0.004</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.47 ± 0.05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>6000</td>\n<td>1.5 ± 2.4</td>\n<td>0.3 ± 0.5</td>\n<td>23 ± 43</td>\n<td>0.00 ± 0.01</td>\n<td>134 ± 19</td>\n<td>0.022 ± 0.003</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.55 ± 0.03</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>12000</td>\n<td>6.0 ± 0.7</td>\n<td>3.0 ± 1.1</td>\n<td>299 ± 160</td>\n<td>0.02 ± 0.01</td>\n<td>217 ± 17</td>\n<td>0.018 ± 0.001</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.59 ± 0.02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>24000</td>\n<td>7.4 ± 0.8</td>\n<td>5.7 ± 1.4</td>\n<td>1037 ± 618</td>\n<td>0.04 ± 0.03</td>\n<td>312 